-- GPORCA's plans
SET optimizer = on;
SET datafusion.mode = explain;
EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT u.g, count(*), sum(u.a) FROM (SELECT x.g, x.a FROM df_u1 x JOIN df_u2 y ON x.g = y.k UNION ALL SELECT y.g, y.a FROM df_u2 y JOIN df_u1 x ON y.g = x.k) u GROUP BY u.g ORDER BY 1;
                                              QUERY PLAN                                              
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
   Merge Key: x.g
   ->  Sort
         Sort Key: x.g
         ->  HashAggregate
               Group Key: x.g
               ->  Append
                     ->  Hash Join
                           Hash Cond: (x.g = y.k)
                           ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                                 Hash Key: x.g
                                 ->  Seq Scan on df_u1 x
                           ->  Hash
                                 ->  Seq Scan on df_u2 y
                     ->  Hash Join
                           Hash Cond: (y_1.g = x_1.k)
                           ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice3; segments: 3)
                                 Hash Key: y_1.g
                                 ->  Seq Scan on df_u2 y_1
                           ->  Hash
                                 ->  Seq Scan on df_u1 x_1
 Optimizer: GPORCA
 DataFusion: slice 0 not eligible: receives rows from a Gather Motion with nothing to compute on them
 DataFusion: slice 1 eligible
 DataFusion: slice 2 eligible, sends Arrow batches
 DataFusion: slice 3 eligible, sends Arrow batches
(26 rows)

